[32m+[m[32m## 5. Acceptance Criteria[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### UI/UX Quality Gates[m
[32m+[m[32m1. ✅ All interactive elements have minimum 44x44px touch targets[m
[32m+[m[32m2. ✅ Color contrast meets WCAG 2.1 AAA (7:1) for medical severity indicators[m
[32m+[m[32m3. ✅ All animations respect `prefers-reduced-motion`[m
[32m+[m[32m4. ✅ Loading states never show blank screens (max 300ms to skeleton)[m
[32m+[m[32m5. ✅ Disclaimer present on all AI analysis result pages[m
[32m+[m[32m6. ✅ Offline state always visible when disconnected[m
[32m+[m[32m7. ✅ Dark mode tested at all breakpoints[m
[32m+[m[32m8. ✅ Zero console errors or warnings in production build[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Authentication Security Gates[m
[32m+[m[32m1. ✅ Passwords hashed with bcrypt (cost factor 12+)[m
[32m+[m[32m2. ✅ JWT tokens expire after 24 hours[m
[32m+[m[32m3. ✅ Refresh tokens rotated on every use[m
[32m+[m[32m4. ✅ Tokens stored in IndexedDB (not localStorage)[m
[32m+[m[32m5. ✅ HTTPS enforced in production[m
[32m+[m[32m6. ✅ Rate limiting on login endpoint (5 attempts per 15 min)[m
[32m+[m[32m7. ✅ Role-based access control enforced on backend[m
[32m+[m[32m8. ✅ Session invalidation on logout clears all tokens[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Clinical Safety Gates[m
[32m+[m[32m1. ✅ Disclaimer cannot be hidden or dismissed[m
[32m+[m[32m2. ✅ Emergency severity states trigger visual alerts[m
[32m+[m[32m3. ✅ Referral recommendations clearly visible[m
[32m+[m[32m4. ✅ AI confidence scores always displayed[m
[32m+[m[32m5. ✅ No medical recommendations without consent[m
[32m+[m[32m6. ✅ Offline queued analyses marked as "pending"[m
[32m+[m
